{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-bfc763083371","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-bfc763083371","name":"火腿饭团","category":"staple","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/staple/%E7%81%AB%E8%85%BF%E9%A5%AD%E5%9B%A2/%E7%81%AB%E8%85%BF%E9%A5%AD%E5%9B%A2.md","blob_sha":"fb8a37b899375167be04900fd5e831acf2bd0d16","details":{"introduction":"一道简单快手的日式风味饭团，咸香火腿搭配沙拉酱与海苔，口感丰富饱腹。富含碳水化合物、蛋白质和维生素，能快速补充能量。制作难度极低，新手也能轻松上手，从煮饭到完成大约只需 1 小时。","difficulty":"★★★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 火腿\n- 米饭\n- 水\n- 冷冻青豆（可选）\n- 冷冻玉米粒（可选）\n- 海苔碎（可选）\n- 喜欢的沙拉酱（推荐日式 mayo！）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 2 个人吃。\n\n每份：\n\n- 火腿(100g)\n- 米饭(125g)\n- 水(90ml)\n- 冷冻青豆(30g)\n- 冷冻玉米粒(30g)\n- 海苔碎(10g)\n- 喜欢的沙拉酱(20g)\n- 食用油 10-15ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将米饭和水放到电饭锅里，点击米饭模式，等待完成\n2. 冷冻玉米粒和青豆放到锅里，加水没过所有食材，沸腾后静待 2 分钟后，捞出。\n3. 火腿切成 1cm 的方块\n4. 与此同时，加入 10ml 食用油，加入火腿翻炒至火腿上色\n5. 将米饭，火腿，海苔碎，青豆，玉米粒，沙拉酱放入碗中，混合均匀即可\n6. 装盘（如果有的话）"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 沙拉酱的程度可以根据个人口味酌情删减。\n- 可以尝试混合沙拉酱。\n- 参考资料：小红书 - 干饭选手又困了"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：短粒熟白米饭500g、熟火腿120g、水煮黄色甜玉米粒30g、普通蛋黄酱35g；整份约685g。固定熟短粒白米饭和去骨腌制火腿，非淀粉火腿肠；熟黄色甜玉米30g，蛋黄酱35g；不加可选青豆海苔碎，不另外加水；全部称重材料直接拌匀。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":162.218978,"protein_g":5.126861,"carbohydrate_g":22.296277,"fat_g":5.496058},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168932/nutrients","version":"94c40f35122d559e","fdc_ids":[168932,168295,169999,171009]},"profile_id":"family-bfc763083371-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-bfc763083371","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-bfc763083371","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-bfc763083371-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"rice_cooked","grams":500},{"key":"ham","grams":120},{"key":"corn_cooked","grams":30},{"key":"mayonnaise","grams":35}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"94c40f35122d559e","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-bfc763083371-v1.573ab79ab0bf4627.json","bytes":21259,"sha256":"573ab79ab0bf4627f0382ace4f5617e89d6f71bc1228d7d545984735eb828f8d"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-bfc763083371-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-bfc763083371","recipe_blob_sha":"fb8a37b899375167be04900fd5e831acf2bd0d16","version":"1","data_version":"94c40f35122d559e","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：短粒熟白米饭500g、熟火腿120g、水煮黄色甜玉米粒30g、普通蛋黄酱35g；整份约685g。固定熟短粒白米饭和去骨腌制火腿，非淀粉火腿肠；熟黄色甜玉米30g，蛋黄酱35g；不加可选青豆海苔碎，不另外加水；全部称重材料直接拌匀。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-bfc763083371","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"cold_mix","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-bfc763083371-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"rice_cooked","grams":500},{"key":"ham","grams":120},{"key":"corn_cooked","grams":30},{"key":"mayonnaise","grams":35}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":162.218978,"protein_g":5.126861,"carbohydrate_g":22.296277,"fat_g":5.496058},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168932/nutrients","version":"94c40f35122d559e","fdc_ids":[168932,168295,169999,